  "description": "WUZVEU crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C52 H76 Gd4 N4 O25 2+,2(Br1 1-),4(C1 H4 O1),3(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.614-5.101 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 90.31-166.59°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Gd4(μ4-OH)(HL)(H2L)3(H2O)2(MeOH)2]Br2·(CH3OH)4·(H2O)3. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ4-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 3 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
